&oh=00_Af_rFsWLMKYXENQ7syDHXFqsqzU9ayB_et6ta5qTRfu3Dw&oe=6A394BA8"}, {"file_name": "screen3.png", "id": "258935755667723", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75297580_258935759001056_2813863870203173318_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hSUey-rgi04Q7kNvwFySuE5&_nc_oc=Ado8YIgC3_TQeZlNGHXQE4Iw7m8qfAN2XrvL2obdekl0UzqXnvnnlsL4bRIpGaC2B30&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_EzjOElU7QK-y7CuJUGLAOJaltVFM2buinQgPSAwaEOA&oe=6A393C12"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "38982658_535757437737335_5271675859752528110_n.png", "id": "816059002445368", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210893_816059005778701_1392764768497568274_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZMVL126HQqIQ7kNvwGnJ7dv&_nc_oc=AdovT8AJ8OMe41mOQM6HYR3d1jHxvI88_IUAxHAKsg4Gc60Onj3ulvuOlIy0AVd3tGs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-NC5XiyPCklI-9wYskZ9t32gA2usOkHlQgy4IJSFcJWA&oe=6A3931D3"}, "display_name": "The Secret of Retropolis Demo", "keywords": [], "long_description": "The Secret of Retropolis is a VR narrative game of a new kind, a blend of classic point-and-click adventure with immersive cinematography. Embody the witty protagonist of a film noir plot. Meet unforgettable characters. Solve puzzles. Lose yourself in the retro-futuristic atmosphere.\n\nEXPERIENCE IN COMFORT.\nAs a seated experience with intuitive controls, first time VR users will find this game engaging and easy to play. Experienced VR users will find this game casual and relaxing.\n\nSTORY. ART. MUSIC.\nEnter a sprawling retro-futuristic cityscape with an original score, ensemble of voice actors and detailed hand drawn (in VR!) environments.\n\nGOOD \u2018OL ADVENTURE GAME\nBoot up that nostalgia for your favorite 90's point-and-click adventure games. Look around. Find items. Solve puzzles. Keep the past alive.\n\n\n* No robots were harmed in the making of this game.", "s